  "synopsis": "Once, they swore to protect this land; later, they buried that era with their own hands. This season, we witness Bataan's rebirth from the brink of death, the gleaming armor of the expedition, and the fateful judgment known as the \"Rebellion of the Three Heroes.\" When the threat of the demons recedes, the demons within people awaken. Torn between loyalty and ambition, the Three Heroes face the longest winter of their lives. The stars will never fall, Zichuan will endure forever—but can you afford the price?\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)",
